    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A coat of magical frost wraps around you, granting you 5 Temporary Hit Points. Until the spell ends, any creature that hits you with a melee attack roll takes 5 Cold damage. The spell ends early once you have no Temporary Hit Points left.</p><p><strong>Using a Higher-Level Spell Slot.</strong> Both the Temporary Hit Points and the Cold damage increase by 5 for each spell slot level above 1.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-MdafHYud8cB6K1C5\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Use <em>Frost Retaliation</em> on a creature that hits you with a melee attack roll, choosing the level you cast the spell at. Delete the effect once your Temporary Hit Points are gone.</p></section>",
      "chat": ""
    },
